@startuml
title Оформление заказа: отказ доставки после оплаты и компенсация (возврат и снятие резерва)

actor "Покупатель" as Client
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Order Service" as Order
participant "Inventory Service" as Inventory
participant "Catalog Service" as Catalog
participant "Payment Service" as Payment
participant "Logistics Service" as Logistics
queue "Kafka\norder-topic" as KafkaOrder
queue "Kafka\ninventory-topic" as KafkaInventory
queue "Kafka\npayment-topic" as KafkaPayment
queue "Kafka\nlogistics-topic" as KafkaLogistics
database "Order DB" as OrderDb
participant "Платёжный шлюз" as PaymentGateway
participant "Логистический провайдер" as LogisticsProvider

Client -> Gateway: POST /api/orders
Gateway -> Order: создать заказ
Order -> OrderDb: заказ, статус AWAITING_PAYMENT
Order -> KafkaOrder: OrderCreated
Gateway --> Client: заказ создан, перейти к оплате

KafkaOrder -> Inventory: OrderCreated
Inventory -> Inventory: проверить остатки и создать резерв
Inventory -> KafkaInventory: InventoryReserved

KafkaInventory -> Payment: InventoryReserved
Payment -> PaymentGateway: авторизация и списание средств
PaymentGateway --> Payment: успешный ответ, paymentId
Payment -> KafkaPayment: PaymentSucceeded

KafkaPayment -> Order: PaymentSucceeded
Order -> OrderDb: статус PAID
Order -> KafkaOrder: OrderStatusChanged(PAID)
Order -> KafkaOrder: DeliveryRequested
KafkaOrder -> Logistics: DeliveryRequested
Gateway --> Client: статус «Оплачен и готовится к отправке»

Logistics -> LogisticsProvider: создать заявку на доставку
LogisticsProvider --> Logistics: таймаут, заявка не создана
Logistics -> KafkaLogistics: DeliveryFailed

KafkaLogistics -> Order: DeliveryFailed
Order -> OrderDb: статус DELIVERY_FAILED
Order -> KafkaOrder: RefundRequested

KafkaOrder -> Payment: RefundRequested
Payment -> PaymentGateway: возврат средств
PaymentGateway --> Payment: возврат выполнен
Payment -> KafkaPayment: RefundSucceeded

KafkaPayment -> Order: RefundSucceeded
Order -> OrderDb: средства возвращены покупателю
Order -> KafkaOrder: ReleaseReservationRequested

KafkaOrder -> Inventory: ReleaseReservationRequested
Inventory -> Inventory: снять резерв, товар снова доступен
Inventory -> KafkaInventory: ReservationReleased

KafkaInventory -> Order: ReservationReleased
KafkaInventory -> Catalog: ReservationReleased
Catalog -> Catalog: вернуть товар в каталог
Order -> OrderDb: статус CANCELLED, причина DELIVERY_FAILED
Order -> KafkaOrder: OrderStatusChanged(CANCELLED)
Gateway --> Client: заказ отменён, средства возвращены
@enduml
